{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Somnambulo</strong>\u00a0is a psychological horror game exploring identity, traumas, and memory through immersive narrative and surreal exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Milena, a young psychologist devoted to helping others overcome their fears. One night, she finds herself trapped in a mystical labyrinth shaped by the memories, emotions, and phobias of her former patients. Her own identity is fractured, and to escape, she must piece herself back together \u2013 and confront the truths she once tried to forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends atmospheric storytelling and psychological depth delivering an emotionally dark and deeply immersive experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620790?t=1756378998","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620790/62ed3c3169189ed8f9ee369d5a369ab547d55f1e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756378998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620790/19e5898e3addb75609a3813d44cf544e316fc22f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756378998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620790/19e5898e3addb75609a3813d44cf544e316fc22f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756378998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Somnambulo</strong>\u00a0is a psychological horror game exploring identity, traumas, and memory through immersive narrative and surreal exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow Milena, a young psychologist devoted to helping others overcome their fears. One night, she finds herself trapped in a mystical labyrinth shaped by the memories, emotions, and phobias of her former patients. Her own identity is fractured, and to escape, she m